$ symbol-tidy
symbol-tidy: error: no source files given

$ symbol-tidy foo
symbol-tidy: error: no source files given

$ symbol-tidy -- no-extension
symbol-tidy: error: "no-extension": can't deduce language without extension; use -x/--language

$ symbol-tidy -- unknown-extension.x
symbol-tidy: error: "unknown-extension.x": can't deduce language from extension; use -x/--language

